  "title": "Alexandroff Property of Metric Indecomposable Continua",
  "abstract": "Todorov–Valov Theorem 3.3: for two disjoint closed sets with nonempty interiors in a metric indecomposable continuum, one open cover obstructs every separator map onto every nonempty compact connected Hausdorff target. The classical composant properties remain as foundations.",
